      "content": "hey, i'm studying for a moot court competition and i'm stuck. the topic is executive privilege vs congressional oversight. i don't need a lecture on why both sides matter—i need to actually win the argument. in the context of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? pick the stronger legal position for me so i can build my case.",
